<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 20mm 25mm 20mm 25mm;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #111;
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding: 12mm 10mm;
        }

        .header {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff0033;
            margin-bottom: 6mm;
        }

        .header td { vertical-align: middle; padding: 0 0 6mm 0; }

        .header-logo {
            width: 20mm;
            height: 20mm;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .header-title {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 8px;
        }

        .header-title h1 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff0033;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        .header-title p {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #555;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff0033;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            margin: 5mm 0 3mm;
            padding-bottom: 2mm;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff0033;
        }

        .field-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 3mm;
        }

        .field-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            min-width: 60mm;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .field-value {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .field-block {
            margin-bottom: 4mm;
        }

        .field-block .field-label {
            display: block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 1mm;
        }

        .field-block .field-value {
            display: block;
            padding: 2mm 3mm;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: #fafafa;
            min-height: 8mm;
        }

        .engagement-box {
            background: #fff8f8;
            border: 1px solid #ff0033;
            border-radius: 3px;
            padding: 3mm 4mm;
            margin: 4mm 0;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .engagement-signed {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #555;
            margin-top: 2mm;
        }

        .signature-section {
            margin-top: 6mm;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10mm;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .signature-block {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .signature-block p {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 2mm;
        }

        .signature-image {
            width: 80mm;
            height: 30mm;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 2px;
            object-fit: contain;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .date-block {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #555;
            margin-top: 2mm;
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 8mm;
            padding-top: 3mm;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #888;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<table class="header">
    <tr>
        <td style="width:22mm"><img src="{{ logoDataUrl }}" class="header-logo" alt="Logo club"></td>
        <td class="header-title">
            <h1>Attestation de transport bénévole</h1>
            <p>Foyer de Soudron — Saison {{ seasonLabel }}</p>
        </td>
        <td style="width:22mm; text-align:right"><img src="{{ foyerLogoDataUrl }}" class="header-logo" alt="Foyer de Soudron"></td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p class="section-title">Identité du conducteur bénévole</p>

<div class="field-row">
    <span class="field-label">Nom et prénom :</span>
    <span class="field-value"><strong>{{ data.prenomConducteur }} {{ data.nomConducteur }}</strong></span>
</div>

<p class="section-title">Informations véhicule &amp; assurance</p>

<div class="field-block">
    <span class="field-label">Numéro de permis de conduire</span>
    <span class="field-value">{{ data.numPermis }}</span>
</div>

<div class="field-block">
    <span class="field-label">Nom et adresse de l'assurance</span>
    <span class="field-value">{{ data.assuranceNomAdresse }}</span>
</div>

<div class="field-row">
    <span class="field-label">Date du dernier contrôle technique :</span>
    <span class="field-value">{{ data.dateCT|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
</div>

<p class="section-title">Engagement</p>

<div class="engagement-box">
    Je m'engage à prévenir le club en cas de changement de situation (retrait de permis, résiliation d'assurance, défaut de contrôle technique).
    <p class="engagement-signed">Lu et approuvé — {{ data.prenomConducteur }} {{ data.nomConducteur }}</p>
</div>

<p class="section-title">Signature</p>

<div class="signature-section">
    <div class="signature-block">
        <p>Signature du volontaire :</p>
        {% if data.signatureData %}
            <img src="{{ data.signatureData }}" class="signature-image" alt="Signature">
        {% else %}
            <div class="signature-image"></div>
        {% endif %}
        <p class="date-block">Signé le {{ signedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</p>
    </div>
</div>

<p class="footer-note">
    Document généré automatiquement par CoSync — Foyer de Soudron. Saison {{ seasonLabel }}.
</p>

</body>
</html>
